00:04:51.357 --> 00:04:52.892
Also perfect person to talk to.

00:04:52.892 --> 00:04:54.494
So you just have this new book out

00:04:54.494 --> 00:04:55.728
that we're going to talk about as well

00:04:55.728 --> 00:04:56.596
called Traffic

00:04:56.596 --> 00:04:58.231
Genius, Rivalry and Delusion

00:04:58.231 --> 00:05:00.433
