00:05:14.447 --> 00:05:14.747
And,

00:05:15.148 --> 00:05:16.015
you know, the thing

00:05:16.015 --> 00:05:17.250
with a lot of the reasons

00:05:17.250 --> 00:05:19.152
people say that Tucker Carlson was fired.

00:05:19.152 --> 00:05:20.853
I think that there are a lot of viewers

00:05:20.853 --> 00:05:22.789
