00:05:24.857 --> 00:05:25.925
But Fox

00:05:25.925 --> 00:05:27.860
had been somehow in their own minds,

00:05:27.860 --> 00:05:29.629
I guess, holding up this line that,

00:05:29.629 --> 00:05:30.697
you know, all these allegations

00:05:30.697 --> 00:05:33.032
of racism against Tucker and against Fox

00:05:33.032 --> 00:05:34.500
were totally false.

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:35.835
And I do think this line about

00:05:35.835 --> 00:05:36.769
