00:05:48.481 --> 00:05:50.283
that triggered this firing. Yeah.

00:05:50.283 --> 00:05:52.585
And we haven't seen Fox or Tucker

00:05:52.585 --> 00:05:54.253
Carlson comment on that, Tucker, so far.

00:05:54.253 --> 00:05:55.688
