You know,

00:06:22.548 --> 00:06:23.449
I was thinking about this

00:06:23.449 --> 00:06:25.618
the sort of early days of building

00:06:25.618 --> 00:06:27.320
social media and

00:06:27.320 --> 00:06:29.222
